351
00:16:15,380 --> 00:16:18,180
Yes, this is very important.

352
00:16:18,180 --> 00:16:20,940
Mistake number one, reading everything.

353
00:16:20,940 --> 00:16:24,900
Yes, don't read your script word for word.

354
00:16:24,900 --> 00:16:28,180
Mistake number two, using complicated language.

355
00:16:28,180 --> 00:16:29,580
Keep it simple.

356
00:16:29,580 --> 00:16:32,580
Mistake number three, no structure.

357
00:16:32,580 --> 00:16:34,980
Always organize your ideas.

358
00:16:34,980 --> 00:16:38,260
Mistake number four, speaking too fast.

359
00:16:38,260 --> 00:16:40,420
Slow down and pause.

360
00:16:40,420 --> 00:16:43,620
Mistake number five, lack of practice.

361
00:16:43,620 --> 00:16:45,220
Practice is essential.

362
